WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.720
1,288 euros a month.

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:07.670
In France in 2023, a single
person living on less

3
00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:10.900
than that is below «le seuil de pauvreté».

4
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.970
About 9.8 million people
live below that line.

5
00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:16.890
Who else is on the margins?

6
00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:21.140
Often named: some young people
with no job or training,

7
00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:24.410
elderly people living
alone, and homeless people,

8
00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:27.760
«les sans-abri». So who
ends up on the margins,

9
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.270
and who helps?

10
00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:33.200
In this mission, you'll draw
the poverty line in Mission D1,

11
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.390
then trace the vicious
circle in Mission D2:

12
00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:38.220
«pas d'adresse», «pas d'emploi».

13
00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:42.550
Then you'll meet helpers, from
the state to «les Restos du cœur»,

14
00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:45.340
and debate whether aid needs conditions.

15
00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.780
Your mission: find out who
is pushed to the margins,

16
00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:49.790
and who helps.
